			// stanza without args is malformed stanza? That is parsed earlier as malformed due trailing? labels with no args but line "-> labels" has one field type only, our parser allows fields[0]=labels and empty args. Original error was malformed stanza: "-> labels \n" when line had trailing space. When line is "-> labels" without args, need check original. Approx: respond ok and set empty?
